================================================================================
  CADENCE GENUS LOGIC SYNTHESIS SUMMARY REPORT
  Project: PS-02 Mode-Switching Flight Control PID Controller
  Authors: Allen Joe A & T. Venkata Sai Neeraj
  Design:  ps02_top
================================================================================

1. SYNTHESIS EXECUTION ENVIRONMENT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Tool Name:               Cadence Genus(TM) Synthesis Solution
Script Used:             scripts/synthesis/genus_synth.tcl
Target Frequency:        50.000 MHz (Clock Period T = 20.000 ns)
Target Clock Port:       clk (uncertainty = 0.200 ns, latency = 0.500 ns)
Reset Signal:            rst_n (active-low asynchronous/synchronous)
Operating Mode:          Generic Digital ASIC Flow (90nm Flow Mode)
Power Analysis Mode:     Vectorless Statistical Estimation

2. TOP-LEVEL SYNTHESIS HIERARCHY
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Top-Level Module:        ps02_top
Sub-Modules Elaborated:
  - attitude_controller  (Cascaded Roll/Pitch Outer-Loop Proportional Controllers)
  - rate_controller      (3-Axis Inner-Loop: Roll, Pitch, Yaw PID Controllers)
    - pid_controller (x3) (Parallel Q8.8 Arithmetic Computation Engines)
      - sat_mult_q88      (Signed Q8.8 Saturating Multiplier)
      - sat_add_sub_q88   (Signed Q8.8 Saturating Adder/Subtractor)
      - clamp_bounds_q88  (Output Limiter and Range Bounder)
    - derivative_filter(x3) (First-Order Low-Pass IIR Derivative Filter)
    - anti_windup (x3)    (Conditional Integration and Back-Calculation)
  - bumpless_transfer(x3)(Integrator State Recalculation across Mode Transitions)
  - mode_controller      (4-State FSM: ACRO, STABILIZE, ALT_HOLD, FAILSAFE)
  - control_tick_generator(Selectable 1/2/4/8 kHz Timing Strobe Generator)
  - watchdog_timer       (500,000-Cycle Sensor Dropout Timeout Counter)
  - failsafe_controller  (Safe Descent Actuator Policy Engine)
  - gain_bank            (Per-Mode Atomic PID Gain Parameter Registers)
  - config_registers     (Synchronous Memory-Mapped Control Register File)
  - actuator_interface   (Quadcopter X-Configuration Motor Mixer Matrix)

3. IMPLEMENTATION & NETLIST ARTIFACTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Elaborated Netlist:      Elaborated cleanly with 0 syntax errors, 0 warnings
Technology Mapping:      Fully mapped into standard-cell logic gates
Total Interconnect Nets: ~21,600 nets across full chip
Timing Paths Analyzed:   1,118 register-to-register and I/O paths
Synthesis Status:        SYNTHESIS FLOW COMPLETED (Verified via Genus Log)
Generated Netlist:       ps02_top_synth.v (Passed to Cadence Innovus)
Exported Constraints:    ps02_top_synth.sdc (Passed to Cadence Innovus)

